WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
KAI: Welcome back to Q+A. Tonight the Finance Minister joins us.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.800
FINANCE MINISTER: Unemployment is at a record low of three point two percent.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.400
KAI: But unemployment for young Maori is much higher.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.900
FINANCE MINISTER: We've invested 200 million dollars in youth employment since 2023.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.000
KAI: The opposition says that's cherry picking.